{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50263","headline":"小有王君别西域总真 · 李翔","name":"小有王君别西域总真","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从事明真入洞台，便祛秋骨月致仙材。\n绦宫玄圃皆寻遍，龟岫龙洲尽到来。\n闻启玉皇过九奏，教诏金液语千回。\n谓言得道轻离别，重感师恩泣更哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}